        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-116, Palermo Swirl Cabinet Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe fanciful design of RK International's Palermo Collection Cabinet Knob will be sure to add a bit of whimsy to any space. This type of knob is perfect for use in the kitchen, the bathroom, or even on the office desk drawers. The CK-116 Rectangle Palermo Collection Cabinet Knob is available in 6 finishes including oil rubbed bronze (pictured) and satin nickel. It comes packaged with all the necessary installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/swirl-design-palermo-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-115\"><b>Matching Palermo Round Cabinet Knob</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/fancy-palermo-cabinet-door-pull-rk-international\"><b>Matching Palermo Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/palermo-cabinet-cup-pull-rk-international-cf-915\"><b>Matching Palermo Cabinet Cup Pull</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-palermo-refrigerator-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-6615\"><b>Matching Palermo Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Palermo Collection CK-116 Rectangular Cabinet Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
